        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Is the Secret of Winslow’s Manor?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of silence, your elderly and ailing grandmother, Martha Winslow, calls for your help. You travel to her remote, crumbling estate expecting a simple visit. But once inside, time feels frozen, and the air is thick with forgotten memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martha’s mind is fractured, her grasp on reality slipping. Yet the manor speaks through creaking floors, distant whispers, and objects left untouched. There’s something deeper behind her madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you’ll uncover long-buried family secrets and confront the shadows that linger in every corner. But be careful some truths were never meant to be uncovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Tragic Memoirs of Martha Winslow!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is it trying to tell us? Are these truths we don't want to know? Or are they just a figment of our imagination?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traces of the Past!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie and deeply disturbing notes and old photographs! Are these a cry for help, or things that never actually happened?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strange Noises!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whispers, screams, and spooky, strange sounds. What do they mean?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Unexpected Truth?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could what's happening in this mansion be real? Or is everything a lie?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Is the Secret of Winslow’s Manor?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of silence, your elderly and ailing grandmother, Martha Winslow, calls for your help. You travel to her remote, crumbling estate expecting a simple visit. But once inside, time feels frozen, and the air is thick with forgotten memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martha’s mind is fractured, her grasp on reality slipping. Yet the manor speaks through creaking floors, distant whispers, and objects left untouched. There’s something deeper behind her madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you’ll uncover long-buried family secrets and confront the shadows that linger in every corner. But be careful some truths were never meant to be uncovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Tragic Memoirs of Martha Winslow!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is it trying to tell us? Are these truths we don't want to know? Or are they just a figment of our imagination?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traces of the Past!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie and deeply disturbing notes and old photographs! Are these a cry for help, or things that never actually happened?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strange Noises!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whispers, screams, and spooky, strange sounds. What do they mean?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Unexpected Truth?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could what's happening in this mansion be real? Or is everything a lie?</p>",
